Building from source

Requirements: Python 3.10+


# 1. Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/YOURNAME/megabonk-hunter.git
cd megabonk-hunter

# 2. Install dependencies
pip install pyautogui customtkinter pywin32 matplotlib pyinstaller

# 3. Run directly with Python
python megahunter_app.py

# 4. Or build your own exe
pyinstaller megahunter_app.spec
# Output will be in dist/megahunter_app.exe
